{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10100240","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10100240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1010024001:0":{"text":"들었어? <style=\"highlight\">로드 프란츠</style>가 <style=\"highlight\">북촌</style>의 밀밭까지 거의 다 사들였다지 뭐야!","source_cn":"听说<style=highlight>金穗北村</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BB7F32A9DC5A204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010024002:0":{"text":"얼마 안 있으면, 북촌도 <style=\"highlight\">남촌</style>처럼 그 <style=\"highlight\">비싼 포도</style>를 심을 거라더군!","source_cn":"要不了多久，北村也会和<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A708C7413CF7627","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010024003:0":{"text":"뭐? 금빛이삭 마을의 그 늙은 촌장은 포도 심는 걸 계속 반대하지 않았어? 결국 타협했대?","source_cn":"什么？！金穗村的老村长不是一直都很反对种葡萄？他最终还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD30FD68016049E8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010024004:0":{"text":"어쩔 수 없었겠지... 2년 사이 남촌 사람들 돈주머니가 두둑해진 것도 전부 포도를 심은 덕 아니겠어?","source_cn":"没办法……你看这两年，南村的人各个鼓起腰包，不就是因为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BD079479E28BDB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010024005:0":{"text":"북촌도 탐나겠지! 돈 싫어하는 사람이 어디 있겠어! 애초에 늙은 촌장에게만 의지해서 될 일은 아니었던 거지.","source_cn":"北村看着也眼馋啊，谁不想过上更富裕的日子呢？光靠老村长...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58B5DF9F36906CE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010024006:0":{"text":"만약 남촌과 북촌 모두 포도를 심게 된다면... 그럼 이름도 금빛이삭 마을 말고 포도 마을로 바꿔야겠군 그래!","source_cn":"艾雅在上……要是南边和北边都种葡萄，金穗村改名叫葡萄村得了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75F23EEB4018BB2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:汤姆":{"text":"톰","source":"汤姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:托尼":{"text":"토니","source":"托尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}